==Trivia==
*Prior to [[9 February]] [[2017]], the drop rate of the Olmlet was 1/650 after rolling a unique drop before it was buffed to 1/65, or ten times the original rate. Before this drop rate buff, twelve players had obtained an Olmlet.
*The olmlet, along with [[Skotos]], has one of the highest drop rates for a one-off pet at 1/53, due to how the Chamber of Xeric's unique drop table works.
** Of the three raid pets (itself, [[Lil' Zik]] and [[Tumeken's guardian]]), the olmlet is the only one of the trio that requires the player to roll on the unique drop table in order to have a chance to obtain it.
*Olmlet's name could be a play on the word "{{WP|omelette}}".{{Citation needed}}
*Olmlet had a festive override wearing a [[red partyhat]] during the [[2020 Christmas event/Gallery|2020]], [[2021 Christmas event/Gallery|2021]], [[2022 Christmas event/Gallery|2022]], [[2023 Christmas event/Gallery|2023]], [[2024 Christmas event/Gallery|2024]], and [[2025 Christmas event/Gallery|2025]] Christmas events.
*Tektiny's dialogue "STOP! HAMMER TIME!" is a reference to the song "{{wp|U Can't Touch This}}" by {{wp|MC Hammer}}.

